ds_list_add(textList, "It's your poster of the most Legendary Pokémon to ever exist...!", "You don't care that everyone says he's not real,", "Or that everyone says 'there's no scientific evidence', or that there are no confirmed sightings,", "Or that what sightings there were, were later confirmed to be hoaxes,", "Or that you once read an article which showed that the earliest reports of him were probably just kids having seen a Charizard in the dark...", "You believe he's real anyway!! "  )